```console
$ scrapmf --help
╭─ scrapmf [VERSION] ─╮
│ scrapmf orchestrates gallery-dl (and optional plugins) to archive social media galleries.
Run without a subcommand to open the interactive TUI. │
╰───────────────────╯

Usage: scrapmf [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  scrape    Scrape a URL using the configured backend
  config    Manage configuration
  doctor    Check backends and system
  sites     List available sites and their backends
  profiles  Manage cookie profiles
  plugins   Manage plugins (threads, tiktok, termux-scan)
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -v, --verbose...
          Increase verbosity (-v, -vv)

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version

Examples:
  scrapmf scrape https://www.instagram.com/user/ --dry-run
  scrapmf scrape https://www.tiktok.com/@user -o ~/scrapmf --cookies-from-browser brave
  scrapmf doctor
  scrapmf plugins list

```

```console
$ scrapmf --version
scrapmf [..]

```
